NAME
       crypt - encrypt and decrypt a file

SYNOPSIS
       crypt -e|-d [-p passphrase] [-o out] <file>

DESCRIPTION
       Encrypts or decrypts a file with a passphrase using
       ChaCha20-Poly1305, so tampering is detected rather than
       producing garbage.

OPTIONS
       -e, --encrypt   encrypt
       -d, --decrypt   decrypt
       -p P            passphrase (otherwise you are prompted, which
                       keeps it out of the history)
       -o F            write to F

EXAMPLES
       crypt -e -o secret.enc notes.txt
       crypt -d secret.enc -o notes.txt

SEE ALSO
       ssh-keygen(1)
